id: lightning-surge
name: Lightning Surge
talentCategory: surge
prerequisites: Never Surrender, Resilience
description: >
  When you recover your stamina, your combat effectiveness rises.
text: >
  Lightning Surge: When you recover your stamina, your combat effectiveness rises.
  –Prerequisites: Never Surrender, Resilience
  (1)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you use a Healing Surge, you may increase your Soak Value by 1(T) for the remainder of the Combat Encounter.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you use a Ki Surge, you may increase your Wound Rolls by 1(T) for the remainder of the Combat Encounter.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If your Life Points would be increased beyond a Health Threshold you are currently under after using the effects of a Healing Surge, you may use the Power Up Maneuver or Transformation Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

# (1) Ticked in the Healing Surge's window: Lightning Soak (a mark), Soak Value 1(T), for the Encounter.
[triggered/healing-surge, 1/encounter, effect 1]
gain("lightning-soak-mark");
expires("lightning-soak-mark", encounter);

# (2) A Ki Surge taken (the `ki-surge` Moment): Lightning Wound (a mark), Wound Rolls 1(T), for the Encounter. Automatic by
# default, its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/ki-surge, 1/encounter, effect 2]
gain("lightning-wound-mark");
expires("lightning-wound-mark", encounter);

# (3) A Healing Surge that took you above a Health Threshold you were under (the `surge-threshold` Moment) - never Automatic,
# it hands over an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver: the Power Up and the Transformation offered on your latest card (chat.mjs
# lightningPower).
[triggered/surge-threshold, 1/encounter, outOfSequence, effect 3]
lightningPower();
